Description: Modern Graphical Control Center for Zapret DPI Bypass
 Naga Zapret is an easy-to-use graphical user interface (GUI) designed
 to bypass regional Deep Packet Inspection (DPI) censorship on Linux for
 popular services such as Discord and Roblox.
 .
 Features:
  * Complete 100% GUI experience with no terminal requirements
  * One-click automated setup, service startup, and cleanup
  * 10x real packet connectivity and latency testing
  * Snappable real-time log console
  * Bilingual UI support (Turkish and English)
  * Background health check and system tray integration
